WEBVTT

00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:29.286
HAYOM EKHAD ESRE BEYUNI ELEF TSIHA MEOT TISHIN USHMONE

00:00:29.286 --> 00:00:33.294
VERUAYEMET HAGVERET BELA GRINSHTAYN LEVED SHUSTER

00:00:33.294 --> 00:00:39.392
MERAYEMET LEAKORIM BEGIVATAIM BEYISRAEL, BASAFA IVIRIT

00:00:39.394 --> 00:00:40.473
yid-

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:47.868
NOKHON, HATKHILIM BEIVRIT YEMTA AVRI BAEMTSA BEIDISH UNK VEBESEDER

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.997
REU

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:58.421
HAYOM EKHAD ESRE BEYUNI ELEF TISHA MEOT TISHIN USHMONE

00:00:58.421 --> 00:01:02.105
MERUAYEMET HAGVERET BELA GRINSHTAYN LEVED SHUSTER

00:01:02.105 --> 00:01:07.236
MERAYEMT LEAH KOREN BEGIVATAIM BEYISRAEL, BASAFA IVRIT.

00:01:09.113 --> 00:01:12.000
GEVERET GRINSHTAYN BOKER TOV

00:01:11.157 --> 00:01:12.443
BOKER TOV

00:01:12.443 --> 00:01:16.148
ANAKHNU NATKHILETA NAAYOM

00:01:16.148 --> 00:01:17.912
VENATKHILUTO

00:01:17.912 --> 00:01:19.639
MEHAYEL DUD SHELAKH

00:01:20.505 --> 00:01:21.967
EYFO NULAADET?

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:24.921
NOLADETI BEKRINKI

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.118
A- ALIADEYZE IUZE?

00:01:25.703 --> 00:01:28.194
OH ZE KRINKI IR KTANA MEOT

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:32.244
ALIA BIALISTOK VELORAKHOK MIGRODNO

00:01:33.853 --> 00:01:37.441
BEEYZE MISHPAKHA NOLADET, MA YASHMIAKH BALINDA?

00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:43.854
MISHPAKHAT SHUSTER, ABA VEIMA VESHOSHA YELADIM

00:01:43.962 --> 00:01:46.043
HEYEYNU

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:44.917
KEN

00:01:46.043 --> 00:01:50.351
BEMATSAV LORA, LOASHIRIM VELO RA

00:01:50.931 --> 00:01:55.068
AT YEKHOLA LIMNOT ET HAAKHIM VEAKHAYOT ET HA SHEMOT SHELAHEM?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.579
KEN, KEN

00:01:55.068 --> 00:01:56.510
TATKHILIM MIHABKHOR

00:01:56.693 --> 00:01:59.363
AL BKHOR ZEHAYA HERSHL SHUSTER

00:02:00.229 --> 00:02:05.420
UBEZMAN SHELHALMIKHAMA UKVA HAYA BESAFA POLANI

00:02:05.443 --> 00:02:07.532
HAAKA HAYA LIBA,

00:02:07.532 --> 00:02:10.567
AKH- AKHOT SHELI, RIVKA,

00:02:10.692 --> 00:02:11.951
ANI,

00:02:12.312 --> 00:02:13.650
KHAYTL

00:02:12.582 --> 00:02:13.858
AT SHMEAKH

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:14.583
BELA.

00:02:15.045 --> 00:02:20.056
KHAYTL VEDOVIDL.

00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:24.205
ZEHAYA HAMISKHAPKHA SHESHA- SHALOSH BNANIM VESHALOSH

00:02:24.205 --> 00:02:25.536
EH SHLOSHA BANOT.

00:02:26.149 --> 00:02:29.028
SHMOTA OMRIM ANI LO ZOKHERET IM HAMART

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:34.783
AH IMA KORE RAKHEL SHUSTER MEMISHPAKHA TSIGL

00:02:34.873 --> 00:02:37.333
SHMOT EH ABA

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:38.461
PERETS

00:02:38.485 --> 00:02:39.424
SHUSTER

00:02:39.835 --> 00:02:40.532
MHM

00:02:40.532 --> 00:02:43.153
MA UNK PARNOSTIM?

00:02:42.957 --> 00:02:45.381
HAYA LANU KHANUT SHEL UNK

00:02:45.505 --> 00:02:47.408
ZE OD MISAVA

00:02:47.408 --> 00:02:50.988
VEBEZMANIM SHEL SABA ZE HAYA KATANTSHIK

00:02:50.988 --> 00:02:56.363
SHE BEANINU ET HABAYT UNK BANINU HAORIM UNK HABAYT

00:02:56.363 --> 00:02:59.201
AZE MASUET HAKHANUT LIKHUT

00:02:59.477 --> 00:03:03.124
BA AKHOV PIŁSUDSKIEGO AKHAD ESRE

00:03:03.124 --> 00:03:05.363
VESHAMA ZE HAYA KHANUT

00:03:05.363 --> 00:03:07.447
LO GADOL

00:03:07.447 --> 00:03:10.018
AVAL HAYA PARNASA.

00:03:10.328 --> 00:03:13.954
VEAKHSHAV ANI ROTSA LESAPERET ZE BEYIDISH

00:03:13.954 --> 00:03:15.840
MA SHEYOTER KAROV

00:03:15.846 --> 00:03:17.818
LISFAT UNK IM SHELI.

00:03:18.377 --> 00:03:23.079
EKSHEM NOAKH LAKH, NOAKH LAKH BEYIDISH, ANAKHNU YEKHOLOT LAMSHIKH BEYIDISIH.

00:03:19.659 --> 00:03:20.681
KEN

00:03:21.329 --> 00:03:22.829
NOAKH LI

00:03:23.056 --> 00:03:25.627
ikh vil dertseyln in yidish

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:29.627
vos iz forgekumen in aza kleyn shtetele Krinik,

00:03:30.156 --> 00:03:31.424
WO di gantse

00:03:30.342 --> 00:03:31.736
far di krig?

00:03:31.696 --> 00:03:34.481
far di krig, VO di gantse shtetele

00:03:34.481 --> 00:03:36.275
iz geven nor yidn.

00:03:36.687 --> 00:03:39.364
goyim hobn gevoynt untern shtot.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:44.544
zeks toyznt mit tsvey hundert fuftsik yidn zenen geven in shtetl.

00:03:45.175 --> 00:03:46.252
un ale

00:03:45.535 --> 00:03:47.101
vi- vifl? vifl?

00:03:46.252 --> 00:03:49.282
zeks toyznt tsvey hundert mit fuftsik

00:03:49.579 --> 00:03:52.357
bloyz yidn mit a groysn mark

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:56.306
a handl-shtetl un der iker a fabrik-shtot

00:03:56.464 --> 00:04:01.757
m'hot oysgearbet leder, leder UNK un leder UNK

00:04:01.763 --> 00:04:05.014
der leder UNK un dos iz gegangen ⟨nokh⟩ Rusland.

00:04:05.155 --> 00:04:07.303
s'iz geven i a handl-shtot,

00:04:07.303 --> 00:04:09.648
i a fabrik-shtetl ⟨kleyne⟩.

00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:12.534
di shtetl iz shoyn fun nayntsn finef

00:04:12.534 --> 00:04:15.206
iz di gantse leder gegangen nokh Rusland.

00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:18.162
ale hobn gekent KRYNKI

00:04:18.162 --> 00:04:19.695
als a leder-shtot.

00:04:19.819 --> 00:04:21.123
di yugnt

00:04:21.123 --> 00:04:23.570
fun tsvelef, draytsn yor

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.820
hobn shoyn gearbet in di fabrikn.

00:04:26.991 --> 00:04:31.473
dos iz geven a UNK yidishe shtetl

00:04:31.885 --> 00:04:37.262
a kemfndike, ale merstn teyl komunistn un bundistn.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:44.006
di bundistn zenen gegangen oyf demonstratsyes un in toyznt nayn hundert finftn yor

00:04:44.006 --> 00:04:46.850
iz tsvey vokhn geven di shtetl

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.222
a komunistishe shtetl on politsey, on gornisht.

00:04:50.751 --> 00:04:54.553
un nakher hobn di ale mentshn antlofn nokh Amerike,

00:04:54.553 --> 00:04:57.089
ven s'iz ongekumen fun Varshe di politsey.

00:04:57.973 --> 00:05:03.198
far vos? zey hobn moyre gehat vayl zey zenen gevezn komunistn?

00:05:00.403 --> 00:05:05.628
zey hobn gehitst di, yo, zey hobn gehitst di bafelkerung

00:05:05.719 --> 00:05:11.045
un dos hot ⟨gevizn⟩ az zey zenen komunistn un komunistn hot men demolt arestirt.

00:05:11.507 --> 00:05:19.770
un ⟨LUI Sheyn⟩ iz gevezn eyner fun zey, un Shmuel ⟨ZUTS⟩ vos er iz blind gevorn aher in tfise.

00:05:19.877 --> 00:05:23.921
dos iz gevezn a shtetl mit martirer-firer.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:28.663
un di ale, finef zenen antlofn,

00:05:28.753 --> 00:05:32.966
un mistome zeks hot men arayngezetst in Grodner tfise.

00:05:33.394 --> 00:05:35.160
vos ale hobn gevust,

00:05:35.217 --> 00:05:38.063
az di shtetl iz a bundishe shtetl.

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:42.197
mir zenen ⟨dertseytn⟩ gevorn in a bundishn gayst.

00:05:42.793 --> 00:05:45.050
BE shtub iz gevezn?

00:05:43.249 --> 00:05:47.968
di shtub. di mame iz gevezn zeyer a heyse bundistke

00:05:48.615 --> 00:05:54.481
oyf azoy vayt az s'iz geven di folks-tsaytung vos iz aroys oyfn Bund fun Varshe

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:58.096
hot eyner a sh- m- spetsyeler mentsh

00:05:58.096 --> 00:05:59.764
tsetrogn di tsaytung,

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.087
shpeter hot er tsugeganvet di gelt,

00:06:02.087 --> 00:06:03.966
hot yeder bundist

00:06:04.258 --> 00:06:05.551
fun komitet

00:06:05.575 --> 00:06:08.949
gedarft trogn di tsaytung kedey tsu nemen dos gelt

00:06:08.949 --> 00:06:10.858
un ⟨dekn⟩ dem di hoypt

00:06:10.858 --> 00:06:14.760
iz mayn mame gegangen mit der tsaytung ober zi iz dokh geven a froy

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:15.882
vos arbet,

00:06:15.882 --> 00:06:19.949
hot zi mir geshikt un ikh bin geven demolt akht oder nayn yor

00:06:19.949 --> 00:06:22.258
un ikh hob zikh zeyer geshemt.

00:06:22.635 --> 00:06:25.261
⟨nu ikh⟩ zog "mame, tsulib vos tustu dos?"

00:06:25.437 --> 00:06:27.070
hot zi gezogt "mayn kind,

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.042
az me gehert tsu a partey,

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:33.328
darf men ton alts az di partey zol nisht zayn bankrot".

00:06:34.043 --> 00:06:38.171
un dos iz gevezn dem, vos zi hot undz arayngegebn aza gayst.

00:06:38.211 --> 00:06:40.533
shpeter az me iz avek in shule,

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:45.326
shtub iz gevezn a atmosfer vos ver s'iz gekumen fun Varshe,

00:06:45.771 --> 00:06:48.999
khaveyrim un khavertes, Pinkas Erlekh,

00:06:48.999 --> 00:06:54.017
un Yankev Pat, ver s'iz gekumen hot gefunen bay undz in shtub a MOKEM-MIKLAT.

00:06:54.445 --> 00:06:56.447
gegesn un getrunken,

00:06:56.453 --> 00:06:59.310
alts iz gevezn bay undz in shtub

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.567
un tsu dem, iz geven Dovid GOTTLIEB vos iz geven

00:07:02.567 --> 00:07:05.053
der birger-mayster fun der shtetl a yid,

00:07:05.413 --> 00:07:07.967
un s'iz gevezn ⟨er, in der⟩

00:07:07.967 --> 00:07:10.335
nokh

00:07:10.729 --> 00:07:14.334
mit a ⟨geheysn⟩ ikh gedenk nisht yetst dem, dem nomen.

00:07:14.492 --> 00:07:18.114
ir vet UNK, ir vet gedenken nakher vet ir kenen zogn.

00:07:15.868 --> 00:07:19.548
ROZA UNK, VE Yankl der klorer

00:07:19.707 --> 00:07:23.112
vos iz oykh gevezn in komitet fun

00:07:23.112 --> 00:07:25.725
fun fun rat fun der shtot.

00:07:25.815 --> 00:07:31.917
di yidn zenen geven der hoypt un der premyer iz gevezn a goy, vayl andersh hot men nisht gekent.

00:07:32.278 --> 00:07:35.630
dos iz gevezn di kindheyt, iz geven a gute,

00:07:35.704 --> 00:07:39.877
nor mayn tate iz geven a bisl komunistish geshtimt

00:07:39.877 --> 00:07:42.206
un im iz nisht gefeln gevorn

00:07:42.206 --> 00:07:45.741
vi azoy di Polyakn batsien zikh tsu di yidn,

00:07:45.741 --> 00:07:50.244
vi me kumt un me gloybt dir nisht, un me nemt tsu podatkes.

00:07:50.284 --> 00:07:54.854
un er hot nor getseyln vi avektsuforn ergets nokh Urugvay,

00:07:54.854 --> 00:08:02.681
nokh Amerike. un er iz avekgeforn demolt in zeks un tsvantsikstn, in zibn un tsvantsikstn yor nokh Kuba.

00:08:03.025 --> 00:08:08.858
dray yor iz mayn tate geven in Kuba un zayner a bruder iz gekumen helfn.

00:08:09.032 --> 00:08:12.682
biz mir veln, bi- di kinder veln hobn vos tsu esn un er vet

00:08:12.682 --> 00:08:16.434
makhn epes gelt un er vet undz demolt ibernemen.

00:08:16.434 --> 00:08:21.090
ober layder hot er nisht gekont oyshaltn dem klimat fun Kuba

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:23.646
er hot gekrign a shvern ekzeme

00:08:23.646 --> 00:08:25.867
un er hot zikh umgekert tsurik.

00:08:26.177 --> 00:08:28.280
un iz geblibn in Krinik.

00:08:28.675 --> 00:08:33.262
BESHALOSHAMIM AYITEM BEKRINKA, dray yor zent ir gevezn

00:08:33.151 --> 00:08:35.121
neyn mir zenen di gantse yor

00:08:33.414 --> 00:08:35.689
onem tate, neyn, on dem tatn?

00:08:35.121 --> 00:08:39.485
yo, s'iz geven der feter, der bruder fun Byalistok un er hot gefirt dem

00:08:36.741 --> 00:08:37.545
aha

00:08:39.205 --> 00:08:40.312
di gesheft

00:08:39.677 --> 00:08:43.788
di gesheft, altsding, vayl di mame iz geven a ⟨groyse⟩ gesheftsman.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:48.347
un di mame iz geven, er iz bloyz geforn brengen skhoyre azoy vi der tate,

00:08:48.347 --> 00:08:52.121
der tate flegt avekforn nokh Varshe, nokh Byalistok brengen

00:08:52.121 --> 00:08:55.464
di di eybershtif fun di shikh

00:08:55.464 --> 00:08:59.769
un in Krinik flegt men makhn di untershtif, flegt dos nisht kostn tayer

00:09:00.045 --> 00:09:02.758
un azoy hot men fardint oyf tsum lebn.

00:09:02.758 --> 00:09:08.223
un di politsey visndik vos der tate tut, hobn gemeynt az mir ⟨vern⟩ gvirim

00:09:08.297 --> 00:09:12.678
hot men ibergekert di shtub zukhn vu me hot bahaltn di skhoyre un di gelt.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.929
un dos hot im aroysgetribn.

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:17.971
er iz geven zeyer a orntlekher mentsh.

00:09:17.971 --> 00:09:21.178
er hot gezogt az a ⟨MASAKHLASA⟩ vi vi do iz

00:09:21.178 --> 00:09:23.259
darf getroyen di birger.

00:09:23.417 --> 00:09:27.005
er hot gezukht dem tsedek un der tsedek iz nisht gevezn.

00:09:27.096 --> 00:09:29.807
un azoy hob ikh geendikt di folks-shul.

00:09:30.049 --> 00:09:35.763
ir kent dertseyln vegn di shule, vi azoy hot ir, ir hot gelernt, vos hot men gelernt?

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:34.353
yo

00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:41.766
ale kinder ⟨komun-⟩ UNK a yidishn UNK gimnazye s'iz bay undz nisht gevezn.

00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:38.632
a yidishe shule

00:09:41.766 --> 00:09:44.893
dos hot men gemuzt forn nokh der Grodne oder Byalistok.

00:09:44.916 --> 00:09:48.068
bay undz iz gevezn tsvey yidishe folks-shules

00:09:48.068 --> 00:09:49.938
MICHALEWICZ un MEDEM.

00:09:50.451 --> 00:09:54.005
un in di shules zenen kimat ale kinder gegangen.

00:09:54.012 --> 00:09:55.932
di shpeterdike yorn

00:09:55.932 --> 00:10:01.728
hobn zikh shoyn opgeefnt a hebreishe shule un s'iz gevezn a shule a poylishe

00:10:01.728 --> 00:10:03.118
far ale kinder.

00:10:03.225 --> 00:10:05.696
mayn eyn shvester, Rivke,

00:10:05.696 --> 00:10:11.015
iz gegangen in a poylisher shule vayl zi iz gevolt zayn mit ale khavertes glaykh.

00:10:11.258 --> 00:10:14.576
ikh bin gegangen in der yidisher shule zibn yor

00:10:15.038 --> 00:10:17.209
un nakher iz bay undz geven a

00:10:16.135 --> 00:10:19.217
ir hot gelernt oyf yidish oder?

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.038
oyf yidish, poylish,

00:10:20.038 --> 00:10:24.414
me hot gemuzt opgebn ⟨di⟩ ekzamen ⟨iz, iz⟩ say ⟨oyf⟩ yidish un say ⟨oyf⟩ poylish.

00:10:25.045 --> 00:10:27.148
bay undz iz gevezn a lerer

00:10:27.154 --> 00:10:30.660
az der hot undz tsugegreyt.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:34.131
ikh hob gevolt zayn a lererke in prebl-seminar

00:10:34.131 --> 00:10:38.393
vi heyst UNK far klenere kinder in ershte, tsveyte, drite klas

00:10:38.393 --> 00:10:40.323
hob ikh gedarft durkhgeyn

00:10:40.323 --> 00:10:42.828
dem prebl-seminar in Vilne.

00:10:42.828 --> 00:10:48.160
az er, der lerer GELLER, er iz afile do gevezn ⟨in⟩ nisht lang geshtorbn

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.171
hot er undz tsugegreyt,

00:10:50.171 --> 00:10:53.444
az mir zoln kenen shpringen glaykh in tsveytn klas.

00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:55.909
ven mir zenen gekumen nokh Vilne,

00:10:55.909 --> 00:11:01.171
hot zikh aroysgevizn az di komunistn hobn dortn ⟨UNK⟩gehaltn a MASÓWKI

00:11:01.171 --> 00:11:03.440
un me hot tsugemakht dem prebl-seminar.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.297
un azoy bin ikh nokh in shule geblibn shteyn

00:11:06.405 --> 00:11:09.926
mit nokh tsvey khavertes vos mir zenen geven tsuzamen.

00:11:09.983 --> 00:11:12.339
un mir hobn nisht gevust vos vayter tsu ton.

00:11:12.598 --> 00:11:13.959
eyn yor

00:11:14.016 --> 00:11:19.039
hob ikh tsugele- hob ikh tsugelernt kinder vos zenen geven shvakh oyf khezhbm

00:11:19.095 --> 00:11:21.232
un oyf yidish.

00:11:22.217 --> 00:11:28.457
un ⟨s'iz⟩ ⟨adurkh⟩gegangen der yor, dos zenen ⟨dokh⟩ geven zeyer kleyne fardinstn

00:11:28.457 --> 00:11:30.446
hot men getrakht vos tsu ton.

00:11:30.857 --> 00:11:34.242
un damolt iz gekumen mayn feter, der mame's bruder,

00:11:34.242 --> 00:11:37.739
vos hot gevoynt bay undz un hot gezogt "BELA,

00:11:37.739 --> 00:11:39.975
du forst mit mir in Byalistok,

00:11:39.975 --> 00:11:42.414
mayn froy iz a gute shnayderke

00:11:42.414 --> 00:11:44.959
un du vest bay ir lernen shnayderay".

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.851
kh'vil nor dertseyln dem ⟨lebn⟩ fun dem Skif un fun dem Bund

00:11:50.851 --> 00:11:52.323
in Krinik.

00:11:51.597 --> 00:11:52.418
yo

00:11:52.339 --> 00:11:56.082
iz koydem zenen gevezn oykhet UNK gants frume

00:11:56.082 --> 00:11:58.797
mit berd zenen bay undz nisht gevezn

00:11:59.161 --> 00:12:03.686
vi kh'hob nokh dem gezen in Lodzh un in PABIANIEC.

00:12:03.686 --> 00:12:05.051
bay undz zenen gevezn

00:12:05.051 --> 00:12:06.299
frume mentshn

00:12:06.299 --> 00:12:08.566
un ⟨s'iz oykh⟩ gevezn a kheyder.

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:11.236
keyn yeshive iz nisht gevezn.

00:12:11.236 --> 00:12:13.161
dos iz gevezn merer

00:12:13.161 --> 00:12:18.555
azolkhe m- mentshn vos zenen gekumen oykhet fun Poyln un zey hobn dos geshafn

00:12:18.555 --> 00:12:23.386
dem kheyder. vos nisht keyn sakh mentshn ober s'hobn gelernt dortn.

00:12:23.386 --> 00:12:25.419
kinder vos hobn gelt hobn gevolt

00:12:25.419 --> 00:12:26.879
az zoln lernen

00:12:26.879 --> 00:12:29.576
⟨zayn⟩ vos zoln visn fun der historye.

00:12:29.565 --> 00:12:31.348
yidishkeyt

00:12:30.679 --> 00:12:31.929
yidishkeyt, yo.

00:12:31.945 --> 00:12:35.757
di brider hobn gelernt in dem kheyder UNK?

00:12:31.978 --> 00:12:33.372
un azoy

00:12:34.729 --> 00:12:38.373
eyn bruder hot gelernt un der tsveyter hot nisht gevolt.

00:12:38.373 --> 00:12:41.282
dos hot men nisht getsvungen, ver es hot gevolt.

00:12:41.282 --> 00:12:43.555
un der driter hot shoyn nisht bavizn.

00:12:43.555 --> 00:12:45.947
der driter iz geven a kleyninker.

00:12:45.947 --> 00:12:51.222
un azoy UNK vi der Bund iz gevezn yede yor

00:12:51.222 --> 00:12:54.664
iz mayn mame gegangen mit der fon fun Bund di ershte

00:12:54.664 --> 00:12:57.521
in der demonstratsye yedn ershtn may.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:01.911
un di shtetl iz gevezn in aza min shteyger

00:13:01.911 --> 00:13:04.962
azoy vi s'volt do gevezn der sotsyalizm.

00:13:05.779 --> 00:13:09.874
eygntlekh iz zi geven a groyse idealistke

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.979
un zi hot ⟨gearbet⟩ punkt vi do in ⟨HADASSAH⟩.

00:13:12.979 --> 00:13:17.849
yedn fraytik hot zi ge- gegangen tsu ⟨der raykher⟩ un hot opgenumen khales,

00:13:17.849 --> 00:13:20.167
zi un Blumke di shnayderke.

00:13:20.224 --> 00:13:23.141
un genumen khales, un genumen

00:13:23.141 --> 00:13:24.808
vos eyner hot gegebn.

00:13:25.877 --> 00:13:30.818
un hot es arayngetrogn, zi hot shoyn gevust di UNK shtiber vos s'iz nishto vos tsu esn

00:13:30.818 --> 00:13:32.587
oder man iz a shiker.

00:13:32.762 --> 00:13:35.743
un dos iz geven zeyer veynik ober s'iz geven.

00:13:36.373 --> 00:13:40.467
un zi hot gevust az eyner hot khasene gehat mit a froy

00:13:40.542 --> 00:13:42.272
nisht vayt fun undz

00:13:42.272 --> 00:13:46.239
un er iz antlofn nokh Argentine un ibergelozn finef kinder.

00:13:46.532 --> 00:13:49.333
mayn mame hot dos nisht gekent oyshaltn.

00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:52.719
zi hot organirt- -zirt a grupe froyen

00:13:52.911 --> 00:13:56.418
un me flegt araynbrengen in shtub un me flegt ale ⟨zin⟩

00:13:56.418 --> 00:14:01.193
di shnayde- di Blumke di shnayderke flegt oyfnemen eyzelekh mit altsding

00:14:01.193 --> 00:14:06.141
un mi- un mayn mame hot zikh gevendt tsu Krinker vos zenen geven in Amerike

00:14:06.141 --> 00:14:07.757
un in Argentine,

00:14:07.757 --> 00:14:12.441
az me darf zen der man er zol aroysshikn a vize far di

00:14:12.441 --> 00:14:15.515
far der froy mit di kinder, finef kinder.

00:14:15.515 --> 00:14:19.461
un me hot im nisht gekent gefinen, er hot geshikert un gelegn

00:14:19.461 --> 00:14:21.899
biz s'iz eyner der fun KRYNKI

00:14:21.899 --> 00:14:24.498
avek un hot im opgezukht in a dorf

00:14:24.498 --> 00:14:28.691
un er hot im gezogt "tomer zogstu nisht shikt men dir bald aroys fun Argentine"

00:14:28.691 --> 00:14:31.399
un demolt er hot aroysshikt di WIZY

00:14:31.399 --> 00:14:34.262
un mayn mame mit Blumkele ⟨shnayderke⟩

00:14:34.262 --> 00:14:37.640
hobn aroysgefirt di kinder biz tsum DANZIG.

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:42.866
kedey optsushikn ⟨geneyt⟩ di kleydelekh mit ontsiglekh mit altsding

00:14:42.866 --> 00:14:44.123
un ongekumen

00:14:44.123 --> 00:14:47.934
haynt, haynt zenen tsvey kinder do in Yisroel.

00:14:48.767 --> 00:14:51.393
mayn mishpokhe iz keyn mol nisht geblibn.

00:14:51.754 --> 00:14:53.958
zeks kinder zaynen mir gevezn

00:14:53.965 --> 00:14:55.967
di eltste shvester LIBI

00:14:56.192 --> 00:14:58.666
hot ⟨gegesn⟩ stolyar fun man

00:14:58.666 --> 00:15:00.897
vos er hot gehat a yingele Leybele.

00:15:00.897 --> 00:15:05.569
Leybl iz geven a vunder sheyn yingele, ikh fleg mit im keseyder shpatsirn.

00:15:05.608 --> 00:15:09.212
nakher di tsveyte shvester hot gehat a yingele,

00:15:09.212 --> 00:15:11.282
geven alt a onderthalbn yor

00:15:11.282 --> 00:15:13.363
kh'gedenk nit dem nomen,

00:15:13.363 --> 00:15:17.127
kh'ken zikh nit ⟨dermonen⟩, dos iz gevezn azoy shoyn in der milkhome.

00:15:17.961 --> 00:15:20.807
un di di gantse zakh

00:15:21.167 --> 00:15:26.274
vos di mame hot opgeton vil ikh dokh fareybikn, un der tate iz geven a guter mentsh.

00:15:26.533 --> 00:15:30.003
ober di mame iz geven ma- mamesh a folks-froy.

00:15:31.849 --> 00:15:35.080
shtendik fleg ikh zogn az ikh vil dos

00:15:33.148 --> 00:15:38.559
in in POYLAND iz dos iz nisht geven azoy oftlekh tsu gefinen a

00:15:37.317 --> 00:15:40.535
yo, s'iz geven a sakh froyen vos hobn gemakht

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.859
yo

00:15:40.535 --> 00:15:44.272
ober zeltn, zeltn in di ⟨UNK⟩ zaytn in

00:15:43.358 --> 00:15:45.191
 yo

00:15:44.272 --> 00:15:48.747
Lodzh, in Varshe, in undzer zayt, in rusishn zayt mer.

00:15:48.032 --> 00:15:48.971
mer

00:15:48.808 --> 00:15:50.990
oy iz geven azelkhe froyen

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:55.032
iz zi geven zeyer aktiv un aza farnumen un gegangen

00:15:55.032 --> 00:15:58.269
un zi hot zeyer a sakh gearbet in dem gesheft UNK.

00:15:58.512 --> 00:16:01.543
di shule hob mir ge- hob ikh geendikt

00:16:01.684 --> 00:16:05.486
zeyer gut. geforn vayter bin ikh nisht

00:16:05.486 --> 00:16:09.578
bin ge- arayn in Skif, in Skif ⟨vider⟩ geven sekretarke.

00:16:09.578 --> 00:16:12.208
un mayner a khaver fun Urugvay vos

00:16:11.404 --> 00:16:16.207
ir kent zogn vos iz di nomen Skif, vos iz di oysyes?

00:16:15.927 --> 00:16:18.131
Skif iz di yugnt-organizatsye fun Bund.

00:16:17.513 --> 00:16:20.291
vos iz di S.?

00:16:18.677 --> 00:16:19.261
di kinder

00:16:20.331 --> 00:16:21.455
K.

00:16:20.382 --> 00:16:22.822
Skif dos, der kh- ⟨snif⟩

00:16:22.879 --> 00:16:24.830
fun di, fun di kinder

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.796
fun di yugnt ⟨az⟩ nakher iz geven Tsukunft.

00:16:26.203 --> 00:16:27.192
yo

00:16:28.684 --> 00:16:29.623
aha

00:16:28.836 --> 00:16:30.500
dos iz der kumediker.

00:16:30.625 --> 00:16:34.402
biz zibetsn, akhtsn yor iz men geven in Skif,

00:16:34.402 --> 00:16:38.752
fun akhtsn yor iz men arayn in Tsukunft un shpeter iz men ariber in Bund.

00:16:39.197 --> 00:16:41.033
vos hot ir gemakht dortn?

00:16:41.033 --> 00:16:43.852
ven ⟨mir⟩ zent akh- a-

00:16:42.943 --> 00:16:44.214
a ⟨nakht-teater⟩

00:16:44.214 --> 00:16:46.804
me hot getantst, me hot gezungen,

00:16:46.804 --> 00:16:51.295
m'iz, me hot zikh tsugegreyt tsu geyn dem ershtn may oyf der demonstratsye.

00:16:51.295 --> 00:16:53.704
m'iz geven zeyer aktiv.

00:16:54.486 --> 00:16:57.652
un ⟨mit⟩ kinder dos iz alts vos zey hobn ⟨dort⟩ gelernt.

00:16:58.013 --> 00:16:59.444
dos iz bay nakht.

00:16:59.444 --> 00:17:03.193
me flegt kumen tsuzamen, m'flegt ophaltn masuvkes, me flegt zikh

00:17:03.193 --> 00:17:06.191
tsuzamennemen un ⟨m'⟩flegt brengen redner.

00:17:05.978 --> 00:17:08.144
vos iz geven di ideologye?

00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:10.646
ideologye az me zol oyskumen oyf

00:17:09.636 --> 00:17:11.000
di ⟨bundistishe⟩

00:17:10.685 --> 00:17:13.256
di der Bund hot gehat ⟨di a⟩ ideologye

00:17:13.256 --> 00:17:15.120
az me zol, yidn

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:19.821
darfn oyskemfn zeyer frayheyt oyf zeyer shprakh, oyf yidish

00:17:19.821 --> 00:17:23.234
un keyner zol undz nit zogn kedey vos mir zoln ton.

00:17:23.798 --> 00:17:26.977
un, un lebn vu? in Poyln?

00:17:25.619 --> 00:17:26.642
un lebn

00:17:26.977 --> 00:17:27.814
in POLEN?

00:17:27.499 --> 00:17:29.045
in Poyln, yo.

00:17:28.566 --> 00:17:29.057
yo

00:17:29.045 --> 00:17:31.490
keyner hot nokh demolt nisht getrakht vegn dem.

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:35.017
ersht shpeter hot zikh geshaft a hebreishe shule

00:17:35.017 --> 00:17:38.929
un di kinder hobn shoyn ongehoybn a sakh redn ivrit,

00:17:39.002 --> 00:17:42.238
un dos iz shoyn geven di ershte tsienistn.

00:17:42.238 --> 00:17:47.624
khotsh bay undz iz shpeter gevezn shtarke tsienistn vi s'iz geven ⟨BENDET NISHT⟩

00:17:47.624 --> 00:17:50.533
⟨BENDET NIF⟩ vos hot gearbet in HISTADRUT.

00:17:50.533 --> 00:17:53.465
un s'iz geven nokh eyntslne, eyntslne

00:17:53.465 --> 00:17:57.288
vos zenen nisht gevezn azoy bakant.

00:17:57.598 --> 00:18:02.809
er iz gekumen, er iz shoyn geven in Erets-Yisroel, er iz geven a lerer, er iz gekumen in Krinik tsurik

00:18:02.809 --> 00:18:05.422
kedey tsu shafn di organizatsye.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:08.814
un se hot gehat a sakh erfolg.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.999
a sakh kinder zenen arayn in shule.

00:18:11.999 --> 00:18:15.988
nisht azoy vi in der yidishe ober s'iz geven a sakh kinder,

00:18:15.988 --> 00:18:18.174
m'ot ongehoybn redn ivrit

00:18:18.174 --> 00:18:22.414
un me hot zikh gegreyt az di yi- hebreishe shule

00:18:22.414 --> 00:18:24.766
zol oykhet kenen hobn a gimnazye,

00:18:24.766 --> 00:18:27.531
azoy hobn zey gevolt, vos iz geven a shvere zakh.

00:18:27.545 --> 00:18:29.498
do hot mitgeholfn

00:18:29.498 --> 00:18:31.337
der SOKHNUT demolt,

00:18:31.337 --> 00:18:33.731
Erets-Yisroel hot mitgeholfn,

00:18:33.731 --> 00:18:35.360
az me zol avek.

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:38.824
⟨vos zol vos a sakh⟩ ongehoybn di maysim mit di goyim

00:18:38.824 --> 00:18:41.622
vos me hot gezogt "ŻYDZI DO PALESTYNY"

00:18:41.622 --> 00:18:43.525
ober dos iz shoyn gevezn shpeter.

00:18:44.359 --> 00:18:46.505
ikh hob farendikt di shule

00:18:46.505 --> 00:18:51.092
un kh'bin geven a budnistk-, a a skifistke, nokh nisht keyn Tsukunft afile.

00:18:51.177 --> 00:18:54.443
un ikh bin avekgeforn nokh Byalistok.

00:18:53.978 --> 00:18:56.773
ikh vil nokh fregn vegn KRYNKI

00:18:56.779 --> 00:19:03.239
ir hot gehat bakante goyim, goyim

00:19:01.061 --> 00:19:02.371
khavertes?

00:19:03.239 --> 00:19:06.982
khavertes fun fun goyim oder ze- ir zent geven

00:19:04.061 --> 00:19:08.656
neyn, ikh, mir zenen geven a yidishe shule nor tsvishn yidn.

00:19:08.656 --> 00:19:13.123
nor mayn foter hot er gehat zeyer, in gesheft hot er ah gehat bakante

00:19:13.123 --> 00:19:16.652
bay undz iz nisht gevezn keyn Polyakn, nor Vaysrusn,

00:19:16.742 --> 00:19:19.267
khaveyrim oyf toyt un oyf lebn.

00:19:19.611 --> 00:19:22.876
un derfar bin ikh nokh der milkhome geven azoy zikher,

00:19:22.876 --> 00:19:25.061
az mayn tate mit der mame lebn

00:19:25.061 --> 00:19:28.087
un in fir un fertsikstn yor bin ikh gelofn shnel

00:19:28.087 --> 00:19:30.118
efsher vel ikh imetsn gefinen.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.418
ay, ir hot

00:19:30.242 --> 00:19:34.134
nokh in di PARTYZANCKIE kleyder, mitn revolver.

00:19:34.427 --> 00:19:38.490
azoy b- gekumen, ikh hob gezogt, dos vel ikh dertseyln shpeter

00:19:37.443 --> 00:19:38.515
⟨na⟩

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.402
ober ikh bin geven zikher, vayl er hot gehat zeyer a sakh khaveyrim

00:19:42.402 --> 00:19:44.742
ober keyner hot nisht gekent helfn.

00:19:44.742 --> 00:19:48.350
vayl aleyn hot zikh mayn tate mit der mame nisht gevolt rateven.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.381
zey hobn gevolt mit di kinder.

00:19:50.381 --> 00:19:54.924
un mit kinder hot keyner nisht gevolt rizikirn un zey hobn nisht gekent rizikirn.

00:19:53.884 --> 00:19:56.223
yo, ir hot, ir hot dertseylt.

00:19:55.639 --> 00:20:00.664
yo, er hot gedarft nemen di shvester mitn yingele, un di tsveyte shvester mitn yingele,

00:20:00.664 --> 00:20:03.243
mitn man un dos iz geven ummeglekh.

00:20:03.402 --> 00:20:06.956
un ale tsuzamen zenen zey gegangen tsu der shkhite.

00:20:07.333 --> 00:20:09.672
ober biz tsu der shkhite, in shtub

00:20:09.713 --> 00:20:13.520
zenen oykh geven may- der mame's a shvester mit a bruder.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.371
vos di eltern

00:20:15.371 --> 00:20:16.989
di bobe mit di zeyde

00:20:16.989 --> 00:20:19.051
zenen zeyer fri geshtorbn.

00:20:19.051 --> 00:20:22.881
der zeyde haynt ruft men dos iz geven a kunstn-MALER

00:20:22.881 --> 00:20:25.856
ober bay undz hot men ⟨dos⟩ gerufn a moler.

00:20:26.065 --> 00:20:28.877
ven m'hot geboyt dem groyse shul

00:20:29.338 --> 00:20:32.994
hot er gemakht dem sufit, oysgemolt di gantse,

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.351
getinkevet, ge-

00:20:35.351 --> 00:20:39.874
gemakht un gemakht di di malokhim mit di ale zakhn

00:20:39.874 --> 00:20:44.587
un er, bay undz iz dos nisht geven keyn kunstn-MALER.

00:20:44.587 --> 00:20:47.540
nor mentshn hobn bavundert vi sheyn di shul iz.

00:20:47.749 --> 00:20:51.171
un zey zenen geshtanen un s'iz nisht geven azoy vi haynt,

00:20:51.171 --> 00:20:53.028
me shtelt zikh un me heybt oyf.

00:20:53.028 --> 00:20:55.741
nor me hot do geboyt a rishtovanye

00:20:56.338 --> 00:20:58.795
biz tsum sufit, s'iz geven zeyer hoykh.

00:20:58.802 --> 00:21:01.732
un zey hobn geshtanen in der heykh un dos alts gemakht.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:06.491
un der shtendik in der heykh iz arayn a flig.

00:21:07.206 --> 00:21:10.814
keyner hot nisht gezen un keyner hot nisht farshtanen, ⟨di⟩ gegebn

00:21:10.814 --> 00:21:13.371
a bis dem tatn, dem zeydn

00:21:13.371 --> 00:21:17.359
in bak. un oykh der vos hot im derlangt, tsu im

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:20.396
un in meshekh fun der nakht zenen beyde geshtorbn.

00:21:22.463 --> 00:21:26.247
a skarbunke iz dos geven, hot men dos gerufn, a infektsye.

00:21:26.308 --> 00:21:30.895
ven es volt gevezn azoy vi haynt ⟨iz⟩ di medikamentn voltn zey nisht geshtorbn.

00:21:30.895 --> 00:21:33.536
er iz gevorn in gantsn geshvoln di bak

00:21:33.536 --> 00:21:37.020
az m'hot nisht gezen, m'hot nisht gevust, m'hot im gemakht kompresn

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.683
un azoy iz er geshtorbn

00:21:38.683 --> 00:21:41.000
un hot ibergelozn akht kinder.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:45.329
fir zenen shoyn geven groys un fir zenen geven kleyn.

00:21:45.329 --> 00:21:47.896
un yede shvester hot nokh tsugenumen

00:21:47.896 --> 00:21:49.700
a bruder mit a shvesterl

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.907
un bay undz in shtub iz gevezn

00:21:51.907 --> 00:21:55.524
a shvester Belke vos mir zenen beyde geven

00:21:55.524 --> 00:21:57.650
oyf eyn nomen nokh eyn bobe,

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:00.946
un Ayzik vos iz nakher gevezn in Byalistok.

00:22:01.071 --> 00:22:02.873
in Byalistok di mume

00:22:02.873 --> 00:22:04.865
hot tsugenumen nokh tsvey kinder.

00:22:04.865 --> 00:22:08.350
ikh un Sore mit Khayken.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:12.546
un azoy hot men tseteylt di kinder di vos zenen geven nisht khasene gehat.

00:22:12.546 --> 00:22:15.965
un zey hobn, UNK ertsoygn.

00:22:16.393 --> 00:22:20.069
in Argentine hot mayn mame gehat a mume

00:22:20.069 --> 00:22:23.306
vos iz geforn in zeks un tsvantsikstn yor

00:22:23.481 --> 00:22:27.423
hot tsu zey geshribn az in Krinik khasene hobn far Belke

00:22:27.632 --> 00:22:30.241
iz zi zeyer a sheyne, di mume

00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:33.257
un ⟨keyn⟩ gelt oyf ir ⟨gebn⟩ nadn

00:22:33.257 --> 00:22:36.387
iz nishto un a shod az aza meydl

00:22:36.387 --> 00:22:38.156
zol stam nemen a bokher.

00:22:38.601 --> 00:22:41.329
hobn fun Argentine di mume un di bobe

00:22:41.329 --> 00:22:44.214
geleygt in ⟨zok⟩ arayn nadn farn meydl

00:22:44.338 --> 00:22:46.340
aroysgeshikt a vize

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:48.129
mit di kleyne gelter

00:22:48.709 --> 00:22:53.855
un mayn mume Belke iz geforn un ikh bin demolt alt geven zeks yor.

00:22:53.855 --> 00:22:55.650
in zeks un tsvantsikstn yor.

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:59.453
un ikh hob azoy geveynt. ikh bin geven zikher

00:22:59.453 --> 00:23:01.505
az di mume az dos iz mayn mame.

00:23:01.505 --> 00:23:04.194
vayl zi hot mir dertsoygn, di mame hot nisht gehat keyn tsayt.

00:23:05.567 --> 00:23:08.972
un azoy zenen mir ⟨mikh⟩ ⟨oy iz zi⟩ avekgeforn

00:23:08.972 --> 00:23:11.630
un ale yor flegt men im fun mayn ⟨hant⟩

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:14.094
oysshe- oyfn oyfn briv

00:23:14.094 --> 00:23:17.412
ontseykhenen vi groys ikh bin shoyn gevorn.

00:23:16.041 --> 00:23:17.154
aha

00:23:17.498 --> 00:23:22.346
nu shpeter ikh bin gevorn greser hob ikh keyn mol nisht geshribn keyn briv tsu der mume.

00:23:22.346 --> 00:23:24.886
vayl vos ikh bin geven di klenste.

00:23:24.886 --> 00:23:28.353
di mame hot geshribn, di shvester hot ongeshribn dem adres

00:23:28.353 --> 00:23:29.254
un shoyn.

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:30.814
dos iz ⟨es⟩ gevezn.

00:23:30.947 --> 00:23:32.979
un azoy bin ikh

00:23:32.979 --> 00:23:37.432
hot men zikh gezegnt, mit a ⟨fure⟩ hot men ⟨zi⟩ tsugefirt biz tsum ⟨man⟩

00:23:37.432 --> 00:23:39.938
un zi iz avekgeforn nokh Argentine.

00:23:39.938 --> 00:23:42.525
un shpeter hot zi dortn khasene gehat

00:23:42.525 --> 00:23:45.412
un zi hot gehat dray kinder

00:23:45.412 --> 00:23:50.263
un ikh hob nisht gevust ir adres, ikh hob bikhlal nisht gevust vu zi iz.

00:23:50.286 --> 00:23:52.288
ven ikh bin aroys fun vald.

00:23:50.845 --> 00:23:52.453
ir vet dertseyln nakher

00:23:52.699 --> 00:23:53.618
yo

00:23:53.195 --> 00:23:55.927
ir vet der- ikh vil nokh vegn, vegn

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:54.711
⟨dos⟩

00:23:55.927 --> 00:23:58.616
der mishpokhe in KRYNKI.

00:23:58.791 --> 00:24:01.299
ir kent dertseyln ir ort

00:24:01.778 --> 00:24:03.375
ir kent dertseyln

00:24:03.668 --> 00:24:07.608
vegn di yom-toyvim, vi azoy iz gevezn in KRYNKI?

00:24:07.608 --> 00:24:09.770
peysekh, khanuke?

00:24:08.427 --> 00:24:13.123
yo, bay undz iz geven normal vi bay ale yidn. yom-kiper,

00:24:13.123 --> 00:24:17.392
rosheshone iz di mame afile a bundistke gegangen in shul

00:24:17.392 --> 00:24:20.536
un nisht gegesn, gefast a gantsn tog.

00:24:20.577 --> 00:24:23.092
kedey di shkheynim zoln nisht zogn,

00:24:23.092 --> 00:24:24.979
az zi khapt epes arayn,

00:24:24.979 --> 00:24:27.030
iz zi nisht gekumen in shtub bikhlal.

00:24:27.030 --> 00:24:28.731
oyf azoy vayt.

00:24:28.731 --> 00:24:32.400
der tate iz gegangen in shul ober er flegt kumen in shtub.

00:24:32.423 --> 00:24:35.977
nisht esn nor trinken epes.

00:24:36.388 --> 00:24:41.402
un yeder yontev iz geven a yontev, rosheshone iz geven a yontev,

00:24:41.402 --> 00:24:45.292
un seyder iz geven bay undz fertsik mentshn.

00:24:45.585 --> 00:24:47.067
ale mumes,

00:24:47.067 --> 00:24:49.725
di mame hot gehat tsvey shvester in Krinik,

00:24:49.725 --> 00:24:52.237
s'iz geven groyse mishpokhes.

00:24:52.237 --> 00:24:58.505
un ale zenen gekumen un yeder eyner hot epes mitgebrengt oder zenen gekumen tsu undz iz geven a zumer-kikh

00:24:58.505 --> 00:25:01.158
vos in der zumer-kikh iz geven a oyvn.

00:25:01.158 --> 00:25:03.737
un ale zakhn hot men gemakht in oyvn.

00:25:04.570 --> 00:25:10.237
un zey hobn ales tsugegreyt dos iz gezesn, demolt zenen geven kleyne kinder, ⟨mir geven⟩ zeks

00:25:10.237 --> 00:25:13.463
un di tsvey shvester akht, un der tate mit der mamen.

00:25:13.463 --> 00:25:14.452
iz tsen.

00:25:14.931 --> 00:25:16.876
un s'iz nokh tsugekumen

00:25:16.876 --> 00:25:19.494
di shvester mit ⟨ire⟩ dray kinder,

00:25:19.494 --> 00:25:21.958
un nokh a shvester mit finef kinder

00:25:21.958 --> 00:25:25.907
un azoy nor di kinder shpiln zikh un me git zey.

00:25:25.907 --> 00:25:28.301
un s'iz geven genug plats far alemen.

00:25:28.301 --> 00:25:33.858
un yedn yontev, khanike un dem iz geven a yontev, oykhet in shule.

00:25:34.557 --> 00:25:36.876
in shule, afile in der yidisher shule.

00:25:35.082 --> 00:25:35.731
yo

00:25:36.876 --> 00:25:39.731
hot men yedn yontev gemakht yontev.

00:25:39.754 --> 00:25:44.886
un m'iz gegangen un m'iz, vayl mir flegn zeyer mekane zayn

00:25:44.886 --> 00:25:48.267
di poylishe kinder

00:25:48.267 --> 00:25:53.402
vos zenen gegangen in di shvartse rekelekh mit vayse bluzkelekh TRZECIEGO MAJA,

00:25:53.402 --> 00:25:54.964
dem dritn may,

00:25:54.964 --> 00:25:59.714
dos iz geven a groyser poylisher yontev ven Poyln iz gevorn zelbshtendik.

00:25:59.714 --> 00:26:02.466
un dan zenen zey gegangen mit poylishe fener

00:26:02.466 --> 00:26:06.876
un zey hobn zikh gefreyt un mir flegn, ikh fleg kumen, fleg ikh zogn "mame, un ven veln mir zikh freyen?"

00:26:06.876 --> 00:26:09.430
zogt zi "mir'n zikh freyen dem ershtn may".

00:26:10.652 --> 00:26:12.213
vos ⟨ken do⟩ zayn?

00:26:11.563 --> 00:26:16.197
ir hot nisht ge- genumen onteyl in dem dritn may?

00:26:15.613 --> 00:26:19.979
neyn, neyn, neyn. mir zenen geshtanen in zayt un gekukt UNK.

00:26:16.824 --> 00:26:17.345
neyn,

00:26:18.617 --> 00:26:23.136
oykh nisht di bundistn vos hobn gevolt lebn dortn?

00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:23.103
LO, LO, neyn, neyn, neyn, neyn.

00:26:23.123 --> 00:26:26.793
di vos hobn gevolt lebn, hobn mir gevolt lebn mit undzer

00:26:26.804 --> 00:26:30.020
als, als yidn, nisht als Polyakn.

00:26:28.061 --> 00:26:29.040
als yidn.

00:26:30.042 --> 00:26:34.371
keyner. m'iz nisht geven frum ober keyner hot nisht gevolt vern keyn Polyak,

00:26:34.371 --> 00:26:37.815
un nisht keyn goy. zeltn ver fun shtetl

00:26:37.821 --> 00:26:41.477
iz geven eyn froy vos hot khasene gehat mit a krist

00:26:41.668 --> 00:26:43.896
un zi hot zikh gevolt,

00:26:43.896 --> 00:26:46.133
m'hot gezogt az zi vil zikh shmadn,

00:26:46.133 --> 00:26:49.900
azoy iz ⟨akhuts ir⟩ nisht geven keyn eyner, me hot khasene gehat.

00:26:49.900 --> 00:26:52.043
⟨tsu⟩ mit poylishe yidn,

00:26:52.043 --> 00:26:58.118
me hot geredt a shidekh mit a yid fun Lodzh oder mit oder fun Rusland, oder fun

00:26:58.118 --> 00:26:59.418
fun ergets vu

00:26:59.418 --> 00:27:02.544
ober keyner hot nisht khasene gehat kimat mit keyn.

00:27:02.544 --> 00:27:06.381
eyne eyntsike froy vos iz arayn in KLOSZ- in KLASZTOR

00:27:06.381 --> 00:27:09.762
iz gevezn, vos der tate iz geven zeyer a frumer

00:27:09.762 --> 00:27:12.122
un er hot ir dervaytert fun zikh.

00:27:12.364 --> 00:27:16.463
vayl z'iz gegangen mit a goy, un zi iz demolt avek tsu di goyim.

00:27:16.463 --> 00:27:19.577
azoy iz keyner nisht geven in Krinik.

00:27:20.177 --> 00:27:22.266
un azoy i- UNK

00:27:22.266 --> 00:27:27.216
azoy zenen mir arum in ⟨t- k-⟩ zenen mir gekumen der BET-HAKNESET.

00:27:27.216 --> 00:27:30.969
s'iz gevezn BET-HANKESET un nakher ⟨iz⟩ geven shtiblekh,

00:27:30.969 --> 00:27:36.195
vos in di shtiblekh flegn zitsn di mentshn vos davnen a gants yor.

00:27:36.195 --> 00:27:39.350
in shul iz gevezn zeyer sheyn

00:27:39.350 --> 00:27:41.419
un m'hot ongetsundn ale likht

00:27:41.419 --> 00:27:45.399
un in shul iz geven ful rosheshone, yom-kiper

00:27:46.300 --> 00:27:51.744
di tsaytn, afile mir als bundistn, mir zenen nisht geven keyn kegner fun fun yom-toyvim.

00:27:52.493 --> 00:27:57.566
mir zenen nisht gevezn frum ober fun kegner fun dem zenen mir nisht gevezn.

00:27:57.943 --> 00:28:00.092
un azoy zenen mir

00:28:00.092 --> 00:28:04.130
bin ikh ongekumen biz ikh bin alt gevorn zekhtsn yor

00:28:04.272 --> 00:28:06.983
un me darf, muz trakhtn a tsukunft.

00:28:07.073 --> 00:28:09.309
un ikh bin avekgeforn

00:28:09.309 --> 00:28:13.010
ikh hob gegat tsvey gute khavertes, Rokhl un MIKHLE,

00:28:13.010 --> 00:28:17.278
vos mir hobn ale dray gedarft zayn in Vilne, in, in Vilne.

00:28:17.278 --> 00:28:20.381
un layder nisht, zey zenen geblibn in Krinik

00:28:20.381 --> 00:28:23.945
un mayn feter iz gekumen mir nemen nokh Byalistok.

00:28:23.945 --> 00:28:27.151
un demolt kumendik nokh Byalistok

00:28:27.151 --> 00:28:30.783
hot zikh ongehoybn a gants naye lebn.

00:28:30.783 --> 00:28:34.421
ikh hob ongehoybn lernen, un kh'hob zeyer shnel gekhapt

00:28:34.832 --> 00:28:36.176
⟨di⟩ fakh.

00:28:35.119 --> 00:28:37.051
ven iz dos gevezn?

00:28:36.790 --> 00:28:39.115
dos iz gevezn bay zekhtsn yor

00:28:37.319 --> 00:28:38.454
nayntsn

00:28:39.115 --> 00:28:42.876
dos iz shoyn gevezn in zibn un draysikstn yor.

00:28:43.337 --> 00:28:45.136
in zibn un draysikstn yor.

00:28:44.773 --> 00:28:45.505
yo

00:28:45.379 --> 00:28:48.224
zeks un draysik, s'iz ende zeks un draysik.

00:28:47.522 --> 00:28:48.553
yo

00:28:48.224 --> 00:28:50.979
un dortn bin ikh gevezn a yor tsayt.

00:28:50.979 --> 00:28:54.958
un ikh bin UNK gegangen in Byalistok in, in Tsukunft.

00:28:55.960 --> 00:28:58.732
un dort in Byalistok, in Tsukunft

00:28:58.845 --> 00:29:01.259
hob ikh, hobn zey BESCHLOSSEN

00:29:01.259 --> 00:29:03.795
az zey darfn shikn eyne fun Krinik

00:29:03.795 --> 00:29:06.000
un eyne fun Byalistok

00:29:06.000 --> 00:29:08.724
un s'iz geven a konferents in Bund in Varshe,

00:29:08.724 --> 00:29:13.724
az ikh zol kumen, ikh zol forn tsu der konferents fun ⟨eynse un tsveye⟩

00:29:13.267 --> 00:29:16.212
mir veln makhn do a HAFSAKA

00:29:16.597 --> 00:29:18.288
⟨nu⟩ BESEDER GAMRU

00:29:16.976 --> 00:29:17.716
⟨in⟩
